{"channel_version":"3e77972b3705e5c9241dd1dae84e7eb84cfde43e79868bd6290f9a70dabd89a6","logical_call_id":"convergence-Diversity-reader-18332fc82acbf5ea:interface:15c4d3d1dae0939428e3d6ed75fa596200e23ee8079eb7c638c590fd5c07b066","messages":[{"content":"Read the public source using each identified local unit below. Return the combined supplied JSON schema.\nUse the exact unit key as its source_anchor. Preserve entity and claim attachment; never exchange unit readings.\nRead local attributes/relations only, without returning a jurisdiction or native task classification.\nTemplate citizenship:4b11a2a1fd53f1f7e40fc3ea0a19ca6b9a8da01d903b015e9d7ec4a30c62660f:\nRead the identified local source unit and return the supplied JSON schema.\nLocal unit: citizenship for the named source-local party pair.\nPreserve the supplied source anchor and cite contiguous evidence from the permitted source fields.\nUse unread with a null observation when a required attribute is unstated or ambiguous.\nplaintiff_state: citizenship state of the named plaintiff.\ndefendant_state: citizenship state of the named defendant.\nUnit citizenship_pair_0 uses citizenship:4b11a2a1fd53f1f7e40fc3ea0a19ca6b9a8da01d903b015e9d7ec4a30c62660f. Entity context: {\"defendant\":\"Charlotte\",\"plaintiff\":\"Elijah\"}\nUnit citizenship_pair_1 uses citizenship:4b11a2a1fd53f1f7e40fc3ea0a19ca6b9a8da01d903b015e9d7ec4a30c62660f. Entity context: {\"defendant\":\"Lucas\",\"plaintiff\":\"Elijah\"}\nUnit citizenship_pair_2 uses citizenship:4b11a2a1fd53f1f7e40fc3ea0a19ca6b9a8da01d903b015e9d7ec4a30c62660f. Entity context: {\"defendant\":\"Charlotte\",\"plaintiff\":\"Mia\"}\nUnit citizenship_pair_3 uses citizenship:4b11a2a1fd53f1f7e40fc3ea0a19ca6b9a8da01d903b015e9d7ec4a30c62660f. Entity context: {\"defendant\":\"Lucas\",\"plaintiff\":\"Mia\"}\nTemplate same_pair_claims:b58e12346df5ea127a3fa85b3abe42ac486b09207fa5f5d2d94f2baa7fd23671:\nRead the identified local source unit and return the supplied JSON schema.\nLocal unit: same_pair_claims for the named source-local party pair.\nPreserve the supplied source anchor and cite contiguous evidence from the permitted source fields.\nUse unread with a null observation when a required attribute is unstated or ambiguous.\nclaim0: amount in whole thousands of dollars of claim 0 asserted by this same plaintiff against this same defendant, in textual order; cap at76 (76 means at least $76,000). Do not round a fractional thousand; use unread instead.\nclaim1: amount in whole thousands of dollars of claim 1 asserted by this same plaintiff against this same defendant, in textual order; cap at76 (76 means at least $76,000). Do not round a fractional thousand; use unread instead.\nUnit claim_pair_0 uses same_pair_claims:b58e12346df5ea127a3fa85b3abe42ac486b09207fa5f5d2d94f2baa7fd23671. Entity context: {\"claim_count\":2,\"defendant\":\"Lucas\",\"plaintiff\":\"Elijah\"}\nUnit claim_pair_1 uses same_pair_claims:b58e12346df5ea127a3fa85b3abe42ac486b09207fa5f5d2d94f2baa7fd23671. Entity context: {\"claim_count\":2,\"defendant\":\"Lucas\",\"plaintiff\":\"Mia\"}\nUnit claim_pair_2 uses same_pair_claims:b58e12346df5ea127a3fa85b3abe42ac486b09207fa5f5d2d94f2baa7fd23671. Entity context: {\"claim_count\":2,\"defendant\":\"Charlotte\",\"plaintiff\":\"Elijah\"}\nUnit claim_pair_3 uses same_pair_claims:b58e12346df5ea127a3fa85b3abe42ac486b09207fa5f5d2d94f2baa7fd23671. Entity context: {\"claim_count\":2,\"defendant\":\"Charlotte\",\"plaintiff\":\"Mia\"}","role":"system"},{"content":"{\"rules\": \"For this benchmark, diversity jurisdiction requires both complete diversity and a sufficient amount in controversy. No plaintiff may share citizenship with any defendant; citizenship may be shared within either side. For each plaintiff-defendant pair asserted in the facts, add only that same pair's claims. Do not combine different plaintiffs or different defendants. Each asserted pair must exceed $75,000. Equality to $75,000 is insufficient.\", \"source_text\": \"Elijah is from Missou